        "pageNumber": 1,
        "text": "A small dragon, Pip. He had a big gift! A big, bright flame. But he felt sad.",
        "illustrationPrompt": "A tiny, green dragon named Pip looks sad. His small flame is burning brightly. He's in a grassy field with blue sky. Colors: Bright greens, blues, yellows. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful"
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 2,
        "text": "No one would play. They said, \"Go away! Your flame is too hot!\" Pip felt so blue.",
        "illustrationPrompt": "Pip, the dragon, looks dejected. Three animal friends (pig, cow, chick) are huddled together looking scared. Background: Simple fence, green grass, blue sky. Colors: Soft pastels, gentle blues. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful"
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 3,
        "text": "A sheep had the sniffles! \"I feel so cold!\" she said. Pip knew just what to do.",
        "illustrationPrompt": "A fluffy white sheep looks unwell, with a red nose. Pip is looking at the sheep with concern. Background: Rolling green hills, puffy white clouds. Colors: Soft greens, whites, yellows. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful"
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 4,
        "text": "Pip gave her warm flame. Not too hot, just right! The sheep felt much, much better!",
        "illustrationPrompt": "Pip gently uses his flame to warm the sheep. The sheep looks happy and relieved. Background: Cozy, warm glow from the flame. Colors: Warm yellows, oranges, soft greens. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful"
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 5,
        "text": "The pig, the cow, the chick all saw. They said, \"You are kind! Can we play, too?\"",
        "illustrationPrompt": "The pig, cow, and chick are looking at Pip and the sheep with smiles. They are offering open arms. Background: Sunny meadow with wildflowers. Colors: Bright, cheerful colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful"
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 6,
        "text": "Pip smiled so big! Now he had friends! It was the best gift of all! He was glad.",
        "illustrationPrompt": "Pip is surrounded by the pig, cow, and chick. They are all smiling and playing together. Background: Bright sunny day, rainbow in the sky. Colors: Vibrant and joyful colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful"
